<h2>Verify your <%= purpose %>
</h2>

<p>Hi <strong>
    <%= name %>
  </strong>, use the code below to continue:</p>

<div class="otp-row">
  <div class="otp-box">
    <%= otp %>
  </div>
</div>

<p class="muted">This code expires in <strong>
    <%= ttlMinutes %> minutes
  </strong>.</p>

<p class="muted-sm">
  If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email - someone may have entered your address by mistake.
</p>